      "necessity_reason": "Comment saving is a supported parser mode within this string parsing target. The old harness always constructs the parser with flags 0, so no fuzz input can enable that mode or exercise the comment handling affected by the selected changes.",
      "before": {
        "requirement": "String parsing must be able to save input comments in the parser context when UCL_PARSER_SAVE_COMMENTS is enabled.",
        "applicability": "required",
        "harness_status": "unsat",
        "reason": "The flag and guarded comment saving already existed, but the harness always passes 0 to ucl_parser_new.",
